      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GALLOPING JESSIE (1) has a strong record here with three wins and a minor from seven starts. Below best last time at Warragul (23.48) in a Grade 5, finishing a 2.25 lengths fifth. Rates on top and should go close. DAINTREE GAV (3) last start finished 7th over 350m at Healesville beaten 5 lengths (19.87) behind Dundee Rex in a Grade 5 on July 31. Looks well placed here and among the chances. ASTON KRISTEN (8) jumped from a squeeze box last start but was quickly into stride and led throughout to score (24.81) at Sale in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 over 435m. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Form should stack up. MY DEAR FRIEND (2) is new here but is not to be underestimated.",
